	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Si vales, bene est; ego valeo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Accepi iam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>binas a te literas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note>, humanissime pater, quibus cognosce<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>re potui te silentium meum plus satis importunum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>inique tulisse; quo tamen usus sum non propter <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>benefitiorum oblivionem, sed partim propter tabellio<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>num inopiam, quibus existimo hyemis magnitudinem<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. Vereinigte Frauendorfer Blätter, hg. v. der praktischen Gartenbaugesellschaft in Bayern, Jg. 1870, Frauendorf 1870, S. 60 (unter "Harte Winter"): "1545 bis 46 gefror überall in Deutschland der Wein in den Fässern."</note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>obstitisse, partim ut possem aliquid certi, quid <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mecum ageretur, describere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quantum autem ex tuis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>literis intelligo, meae<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Nr. 2320.</note> tibi nondum redditae sunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Quod si cognoscerem, brevi te de omnibus rebus facerem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>certiorem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nunc te dignum nihil habeo, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quod scribam, nisi quod rector noster <persName ref="p3088">Sturmius</persName> re<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>versus est;<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Zur diplomatischen Mission des <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> Schulrektors <persName ref="p3088">Johannes Sturm</persName> 1545/46 s. <ref target="file12367">Nr. 2320</ref>, Anm. 36. Seine Rückkehr nach <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> erfolgte erst nach dem 17. Januar 1546, denn noch an diesem Tag verfasste der Rat ein Schreiben an Sturm, "falls er noch bei Hofe ist" <hi>(PC</hi> IV/1 15, Nr. 17).</note> quem ego quoque audiam.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Et d. <persName ref="p1974">Martinus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Lutherus</persName> scripsit Exhortationem ad principem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><persName ref="p3590">Cattorum</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note>,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><hi><persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName>,</hi> An Kurfürsten zu <placeName ref="l749">Sachsen</placeName> und Landgraven zu <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName> ... von dem gefangenen <persName ref="p20318">H. zu Brunswig</persName>, <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberg</placeName>, <persName ref="p5475">Josef Klug</persName>, 1545 (<bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+L+3809">VD16 L3809</bibl> - s. auch ZV25068); vgl. <bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> LIV 374-411; <hi><persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> Bibl.</hi> I 3506. In den Jahren 1545 und 1546 wurde die Schrift an verschiedenen Orten nachgedruckt (s. <hi><persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName> Bibl.</hi> I 3507-3516).</note> ne dimittat <placeName ref="l1041">Brunsvicensium</placeName> <persName ref="p20318">ducem</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Herzog <persName ref="p20318">Heinrich d.J. von Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel</persName>.</note>; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quam te puto habere.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nec est, quod vereare <persName ref="p18137">domi<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>num</persName> meum<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18137">Johannes Marbach</persName>, der <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> Gastgeber <persName ref="p1884">Lavaters</persName>.</note> me sollicitare de sacramento, nam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>si maxime diceret de <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglio</persName>, quae vellet, audi<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ret quae non vellet;<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <hi><persName ref="p18901">Terenz</persName>,</hi> Andria, 920: Qui, quae vult, dicit, quod non vult, audiet.</note> et scio, quatenus omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Lutheranis confidendum sit et quid moliantur.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Accipies praeterea literas<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">literas <hi>nach gestrichenem</hi> hic.</note><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Nr. 2336.</note> ab <persName ref="p1560">Anglo</persName> quodam<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p1560">John Hooper</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>observantissimo studiosissimoque tui, erudito <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>homine et summa humanitate, tuaque amiti<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tia (quantum quidem ego iudico) dignissimo; <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>cui velim, si liberum esset, rescriberes, nam <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>id erit ei gratissimum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Plurimum enim parte<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>s <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName ref="p4091">Zvinglii</persName>, quod rarum est in hac urbe, tuetur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Ipsum praeterea summo offitio et summa ob<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>servantia tibi in perpetuum devinxeris<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Der ganze Satz stammt aus <hi><persName ref="p4543">Cicero</persName>,</hi> Epistulae ad familiares, 13, 3.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/><persName ref="p8051">Uxori</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="13"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> tuae honestissimae et toti<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> totae.</note> familiae ex me salutem <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>dicere ne dedigneris.<pb type="edition" next="116"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l491">Argentorati</placeName>, anno <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>1546, apud d[ivum] Nicolaum<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Die Kirche St. Nikolaus.</note>, ex aedibus d. <persName ref="p18137">Ioannis <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Marpachii</persName>, 27. ianuarii, etc.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Tu fac interim, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>me nulla in re offitio meo defuturum con<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>fidas,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">me ... confidas: <hi><persName ref="p4543">Cicero</persName>,</hi> Epistulae ad familiares, 10, 29.</note> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Tuus <foreign xml:lang="el">παντὶ στήθει καὶ παντὶ θυμῶ</foreign><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">mit ganzem Herzen und mit ganzem Sinn.</note> <persName ref="p1884">Ludovicus <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Lavatherus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adressen auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, pientissimo ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z40"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti, domino suo in<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>primis o<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>bservando.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Dem ersamen, wiesen und h<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ohegelerten herren, h. <persName ref="p495">Henrich <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>, mienem bes<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>unders gelieften<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Vielleicht eine Anspielung auf die Redeweise des Friesen <persName ref="p4112">thom Camph</persName>, der 1545 in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> gewesen war.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>herren und gutten fründt <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
